Here's how to add config file support using `cosmiconfig`:

```typescript
import { cosmiconfig } from 'cosmiconfig';

const explorer = cosmiconfig('md2html');

async function loadConfig() {
  const result = await explorer.search();

  if (result) {
    console.log(`Loaded config from ${result.filepath}`);
    return result.config;
  }

  return {}; // Default config
}

// Config can be in:
// - package.json "md2html" key
// - .md2htmlrc
// - .md2htmlrc.json
// - .md2htmlrc.yaml
// - md2html.config.js
```

Example `.md2htmlrc.json`:
```json
{
  "outputDir": "dist",
  "template": "github",
  "highlightCode": true
}
```
